  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The extraction principle used in extraction of a metal 'M' can be represented as follows<br />\r<br />\r<math> <mrow> <mtable> <mtr> <mtd> <mtext>MS</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>O</mtext> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>→</mo> </mtd> <mtd> <msub> <mtext>MSO</mtext> <mn>4</mn> </msub> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <msub> <mtext>MSO</mtext> <mn>4</mn> </msub> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>MS</mtext> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>→</mo> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>M</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> <msub> <mtext>SO</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable> </mrow> </math><br />\r<br />\rThe metal 'M' is</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "jJBeI",
      "text": "Mg",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
