  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "It is a case of self reduction.<br><br>The concentrated galena (PbS) is partially oxidised by adjusting the air supply.<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>PbS</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> <msub> <mtext>O</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>→</mo> <msub> <mtext>PbSO</mtext> <mn>4</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math><br /><br />The temperature is raised, air supply reduced and fresh galena (PbS) added.<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>PbS</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mtext>PbSO</mtext> <mn>4</mn> </msub> <mo>→</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>Pb</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>2</mn> <msub> <mtext>SO</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>↑</mo> </mrow> </math>",
